{"id":23380,"shortDescription":"Gyromancer is a Pop Cap / Square Enix collaboration. This is a Puzzle RPG. Join Rivel and his companion, Laska, on a grand chase spanning twelve stages. What awaits at the end of the hunt?Each stage contains its own objectives, from defeating the beasts that block your way to solving puzzles before time runs out.","developers":["Square Enix","PopCap Games, Inc."],"publishers":["Square Enix"],"categories":["Un jugador","Comodidad de la cámara","Controles de volumen personalizados","Opción solo teclado","Opción solo ratón","#category_playable_at_your_own_pace","Jugable sin restricciones de tiempo","Sonido estéreo","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"18 NOV 2009","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/23380?t=1776654698","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/23380/ss_c71c0717971810440e63a0f680a46ec7704ded70.600x338.jpg?t=1776654698","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/23380/ss_c71c0717971810440e63a0f680a46ec7704ded70.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776654698"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/23380/ss_5f82ebe093cb57583d21d670a3df0a9f927584ef.600x338.jpg?t=1776654698","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/23380/ss_5f82ebe093cb57583d21d670a3df0a9f927584ef.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776654698"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/23380/ss_96b565c3e0d3138d374d45be5e7bf1fcf3acaeaa.600x338.jpg?t=1776654698","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/23380/ss_96b565c3e0d3138d374d45be5e7bf1fcf3acaeaa.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776654698"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/23380/ss_d61813bb502181a81d00e3bf644d0d11844c0d12.600x338.jpg?t=1776654698","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/23380/ss_d61813bb502181a81d00e